    [T-002] Implement strict named-file acquisition and complete public API
    
    Read complete binary files with strict UTF-8, preserve input bytes/newlines, close owned handles on all paths and propagate original acquisition/decode exceptions. Export the complete silent whole-input API and include tests, accurate documentation, verification/accepted-artifact evidence and initial owning completion in this atomic checkpoint.
    
